  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_01",
      "hash64": "1E1E4EEDD0C2B0A6",
      "text": "Bonjour, les enfants ! Alors, vous sentez-vous plus\\ninstruits qu’hier ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_02",
      "hash64": "1E1E4DEDD0C2AEF3",
      "text": "Aujourd’hui, c’est notre dernier cours ensemble.\\c\\nAlors plus que jamais, préparez-vous à démêler\\nles mystères de l’Histoire en ma compagnie ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_03",
      "hash64": "1E1E4CEDD0C2AD40",
      "text": "La dernière fois, je vous ai parlé du groupe\\nd’observation de la Zone Zéro d’il y a 200 ans.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_04",
      "hash64": "1E1E53EDD0C2B925",
      "text": "Malheureusement, ce cours se rapproche\\nde plus en plus de l’époque actuelle...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_05",
      "hash64": "1E1E52EDD0C2B772",
      "text": "Je trouve que c’est dommage de devoir aborder\\nl’Histoire en allant du passé vers le futur.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_06",
      "hash64": "1E1E51EDD0C2B5BF",
      "text": "Vous trouvez pas que ça serait bien plus\\nfascinant si, au contraire, on partait du présent\\r\\npour s’enfoncer de plus en plus dans le passé ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_c_07_select_a",
      "hash64": "2A85FB8B4ED96C98",
      "text": "Oui, je suis d’accord !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_c_07_select_b",
      "hash64": "2A85FE8B4ED971B1",
      "text": "Ça deviendrait difficile à comprendre, non ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_07a",
      "hash64": "F037F119BAD89537",
      "text": "Oh, merci ! Je vois que toi, tu me comprends,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)] !\\c\\nMalheureusement, si je veux pas me faire taper\\nsur les doigts par le proviseur, je vais être obligée\\r\\nde suivre le programme.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 156,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 183,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_07b",
      "hash64": "F037F219BAD896EA",
      "text": "Oui, t’as pas tout à fait tort...\\c\\nOn aurait peut-être du mal à comprendre\\ncomment un évènement en a entraîné un autre,\\r\\nsi on remontait le cours de l’Histoire.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 164,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_08",
      "hash64": "1E1E57EDD0C2BFF1",
      "text": "*soupir* Bon, ben... On va continuer à avancer\\nvers le futur...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_09",
      "hash64": "1E1E56EDD0C2BE3E",
      "text": "Pour ce dernier cours, j’aimerais vous apprendre\\nun peu l’Histoire de la Téracristallisation.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_10",
      "hash64": "1E1B49EDD0C07250",
      "text": "À l’origine, c’est grâce à la Zone Zéro qu’est née\\nla technologie des Orbes Téracristal.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_11",
      "hash64": "1E1B4AEDD0C07403",
      "text": "Bien que le groupe d’observation avait annoncé\\navoir atteint le fond de la Zone Zéro,\\r\\nl’exploration du cratère a continué...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_12",
      "hash64": "1E1B4BEDD0C075B6",
      "text": "Et, il y a environ 140 ans, des Pokémon diffusant\\nune mystérieuse lumière ont été découverts.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_13",
      "hash64": "1E1B4CEDD0C07769",
      "text": "Vous l’avez probablement deviné, c’étaient\\ndes Pokémon téracristallisés.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_14",
      "hash64": "1E1B4DEDD0C0791C",
      "text": "On a essayé de les ramener à la surface, mais\\nmalheureusement, ça faisait disparaître leur lueur.\\c\\nC’est pourquoi la Téracristallisation est restée\\nun phénomène inexpliqué pendant si longtemps.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 195,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_15",
      "hash64": "1E1B4EEDD0C07ACF",
      "text": "Mais il y a environ dix ans, une certaine personne\\na réussi à percer les mystères de ce phénomène.\\r\\nEt cette personne, vous la connaissez...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_16",
      "hash64": "1E1B4FEDD0C07C82",
      "text": "Hé hé, il est trop tard pour essayer de détourner\\nle regard, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Voici ma question.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_c_07_history_17",
      "hash64": "1E1B50EDD0C07E35",
      "text": "Peux-tu me dire qui est parvenu à expliquer\\nle fonctionnement de la Téracristallisation ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
